  "probeNotes": [
    "The first two correlation-probe attempts selected StdOut/TextMessages instead of the native Message element and failed before mutating inputs. The corrected retained script selected actual message text and completed.",
    "Synthetic signing keys are generated only for the isolated identity experiment; private key files are not retained. Exact inspected public assemblies and their metadata are retained.",
    "Packaging-only relocation: archived experiment .gitignore retained byte-for-byte as .gitignore.bytes so its patterns cannot hide the adjacent retained native build commands and streams. Original manifest preserved as parent-proof-manifest-before-packaging.json."
  ]
}
